{"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Keeps a fraction of the events it applies to, and drops the rest before they are held, written"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or delivered: event by event, or a whole group of events, such as a session, at once."}],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Type-Methods","title":"Type Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler\/events(of:rate:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler\/events(where:rate:)","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler\/grouped(by:where:rate:)"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sampler","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A tracker built with samplers runs them on its worker, after its enrichers, so a sampler sees","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"what they set:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let tracker = Tracker(samplers: [","    .events(of: Scrolled.self, rate: 0.1),","    .events(where: { $0.consentCategory == .performance }, rate: 0.5),","])"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Each sampler decides on its own, and a record is kept only if every sampler that applies to it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"keeps it. A kept record carries the product of their rates as its ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/SampleRateKey","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":"; one no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sampler applies to is always kept and carries no key. Each dropped record is reported on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/samplingDropReports","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The decisions come from the tracker’s sampling seed, the same on every platform and Swift"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"release: with a seed fixed, which events are kept is fixed too. Each sampler draws from a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stream of its own, picked by its place in the tracker’s list: appending a sampler changes no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"other’s decisions, but inserting, removing or reordering one gives every sampler after it a new"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stream, so it decides differently under the same seed."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/sampler"]}],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Trackers\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships"}],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:8Trackers7SamplerV","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Sampler"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"Sampler.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Sampler.swift#L28"},"symbolKind":"struct","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sampler","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"Sampler"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"references":{"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Sampler/grouped(by:where:rate:)":{"fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":